    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/3efda6a7e13ffce4964533619cc1ec2a.avif?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/1b53a56c447cf0f2f77c1fcb40163395.webp?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=24 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/f252b6eb1228c0fb1060a11ac2a537aa.avif?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Packit List</strong> is a light 3D organizing puzzle game that can be completed in about an hour. You will travel across multiple worlds, organizing various themed objects into a bag to progress through the story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/0aac2a41878400944a4d9958a69ae5e4.avif?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Hana is a high school student. She once <i>had</i> a best friend\u2026 until the friend passed away.<br>After losing the friend who was more important to her than herself, Hana loses courage to face the outside world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/0ca511c7df2c8988f23965af9eb2d384.avif?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Not knowing how to let go of a friend, Hana lived in sadness for a long time.<br>Then one day, she wakes up in a world that isn't her own.<br><br>Hana begins to travel through different worlds, organizing various bags along the way.<br>Join her as she fits various shaped items into her bag and embarks on a journey of packing and self-discovery.<br>How will this journey change her life?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/a4ee5ba82a616a60dc2c6bc9c98fc22c.avif?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/592095f857be7151fd5c9a6ecfa4565e.avif?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Physics-based 3D puzzles</strong>: Solve puzzles by perfectly fitting objects into the suitcase.<br></li><li> <strong>Emotional story</strong>: A touching narrative about overcoming loss, the pain of grief, and the warmth of memories and friendship.<br></li><li> <strong>Explore diverse themed worlds</strong>: Travel to various worlds, including realms of magic and swords, or spy gadgets and espionage.<br></li><li> <strong>Charming pastel graphics</strong>: Experience a warm and comforting atmosphere with soft, pastel-colored visuals.<br></li><li> <strong>Beautiful soundtrack</strong>: Accompany Hana on her journey with a beautiful, original soundtrack that enhances the emotional depth of the game.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084150/extras/1b53a56c447cf0f2f77c1fcb40163395.webp?t=1725466763\" width=600 height=24 /></span><br><br><strong>Packit List</strong> offers a brief yet gentle journey that can be completed within an hour.<br>While it may be a short experience, we hope that this journey with Hana helps you learn to say goodbye to something or someone you dearly miss.",
